{
  "name": "identity_read_project",
  "title": "Read project Brand Studio identity",
  "description": "App-only Brand Studio read. Returns the project default reel identity pack, apply receipt, prewarm status, selectable presets/cut styles, account-scoped music-bed library, and authorized account scene identifiers for this project. This is a mirror/read path; it does not re-resolve existing reels.",
